// Framework backend selection. Other languages use the English key fallback.
"A Virtual Mac is already starting or running." = "来宾系统正在启动或运行。";
"Choose the CPU, VMM and Virtualization framework version. Shut down the Virtual Mac before switching. Close and reopen the app if a different version has already been loaded. The GPU backend is configured separately." = "选择 CPU、VMM 和 Virtualization 框架版本。切换前请关闭来宾。如果已经加载了其他版本，请退出并重新打开 App。GPU 后端单独配置。";
"Close and reopen Virtual Mac to load the selected framework backend. Different framework versions cannot be loaded in the same app process." = "请退出并重新打开虚拟 Mac，以加载所选框架后端。同一个 App 进程不能混用不同版本的框架。";
"Framework Backend" = "框架后端";
"Loaded Framework Backend" = "已加载的框架后端";
"macOS 27 (In development)" = "macOS 27（开发中）";
"macOS 27 CPU, VMM and Virtualization compatibility is still being implemented. This backend cannot start a guest yet. Choose macOS 13.2.1 to use the working backend." = "macOS 27 的 CPU、VMM 和 Virtualization 兼容层仍在实现中，暂时不能启动来宾。请选择 macOS 13.2.1 使用当前可运行的后端。";
"macOS 27 is still in development and cannot start a guest yet. Selecting it will never fall back silently to macOS 13.2.1." = "macOS 27 仍在开发中，暂时不能启动来宾。选择后不会自动回退到 macOS 13.2.1。";
"Not loaded" = "尚未加载";
"Shut down the Virtual Mac before changing its framework backend." = "请先关闭来宾系统，再切换框架后端。";
"Unknown framework backend. Choose macOS 13.2.1 or macOS 27 in Settings." = "未知的框架后端。请在设置中选择 macOS 13.2.1 或 macOS 27。";
